{"slug":"/components/navbar","title":"Navbar — Animated React Component — Planes","desc":"A sticky site header that starts as a transparent bar and settles into a floating pill as you scroll, with a hover pill shared across links and dropdown…","html":"<main class=\"min-w-0 py-24\"><section><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1.5 px-4 pb-2 sm:px-8 lg:px-16\"><h1 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-3xl\">Navbar</h1><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-foreground/8 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock size-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg> Pro</span></div><div class=\"py-10 sm:py-14\"><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center bg-background min-h-[60vh] py-12 sm:py-16\"><div class=\"relative w-full overflow-x-clip overflow-y-auto bg-white dark:bg-zinc-950 [:fullscreen_&amp;]:h-svh h-[560px]\"><!--$!--><template data-dgst=\"BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING\"></template><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px] px-4 pt-16 pb-24 sm:px-6 sm:pt-24\"><h1 class=\"max-w-3xl text-[clamp(2.25rem,5.5vw,4.5rem)] leading-[1.02] font-semibold tracking-[-0.045em] text-balance text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\">A calendar that guards your mornings</h1><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-[46ch] text-[15px] leading-7 text-zinc-500 sm:text-[17px] dark:text-zinc-400\">Meetings go where they hurt least, and the first three hours of your day stay yours. Set it once and stop defending it.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex h-10 items-center rounded-full bg-zinc-900 px-5 text-[14px] font-medium text-white dark:bg-zinc-100 dark:text-zinc-900\">Try it free</a><a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex h-10 items-center rounded-full px-5 text-[14px] font-medium text-zinc-700 ring-1 ring-zinc-200 dark:text-zinc-300 dark:ring-zinc-800\">See how it works</a></div><div class=\"mt-14 aspect-[16/10] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-zinc-100 ring-1 ring-black/5 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:ring-white/10\"><img src=\"/images/8.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"size-full object-cover\"/></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl space-y-16 px-4 py-16 sm:px-8 lg:px-16\"><section id=\"installation\" class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"mb-5 text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\">Installation</h2><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" style=\"opacity:1;transform:none\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-foreground/8 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock size-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg> Pro</span><span class=\"text-[12px] text-muted-foreground\">Requires a Planes Pro license.</span></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 p-4 shadow-xs\"><div class=\"absolute right-3 top-3 z-10\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-lg bg-secondary p-1\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy\" class=\"relative inline-flex size-7 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface-overlay text-foreground shadow-sm transition-colors duration-150 will-change-transform hover:bg-surface-overlay/80 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"shrink-0 size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></path><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></rect><path d=\"M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5\" class=\"text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" opacity=\"0\" pathLength=\"1\" stroke-dashoffset=\"0\" stroke-dasharray=\"0 1\"></path></svg></button></span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto pr-20 font-mono text-[12.5px] leading-6 text-foreground/90 [scrollbar-width:none] [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden\">npx shadcn add @useplanes/navbar</pre></div><p class=\"-mt-1 text-[12px] leading-5 text-muted-foreground\">Works once the<!-- --> <a class=\"text-foreground underline-offset-4 hover:underline\" href=\"/setup\">@useplanes registry</a> <!-- -->is set up in your project (one-time). After that, copy and run commands directly.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-xl border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 p-5 shadow-xs sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg bg-secondary p-1\"><span class=\"flex size-7 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface-overlay text-foreground shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-key-round size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z\"></path><circle cx=\"16.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg></span></span><div><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-foreground\">Unlock with Planes Pro</p><p class=\"text-[13px] leading-5 text-muted-foreground\">$99 once · 160 Pro components · lifetime updates.</p></div></div><div class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 self-start rounded-lg bg-secondary p-1 sm:self-auto\"><a class=\"inline-flex h-9 items-center rounded-md bg-surface-overlay px-3 text-[13px] font-medium text-foreground/60 shadow-sm transition-[color,transform] duration-150 hover:text-foreground active:scale-[0.97] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring\" href=\"/setup\">I have a license</a><a class=\"group inline-flex h-9 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md bg-surface-overlay px-4 text-[13px] font-semibold text-foreground shadow-sm transition-[color,transform] duration-150 hover:text-foreground/80 active:scale-[0.97] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring\" href=\"/#pricing\">Get Pro<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section id=\"usage\" class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5\"><div role=\"tablist\" class=\"inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-1 rounded-lg bg-neutral-200/60 dark:bg-white/5 p-1\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"_R_5anpfksnksdb_-tab-usage\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"_R_5anpfksnksdb_-panel-usage\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"relative inline-flex h-9 items-center rounded-md px-4 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring text-foreground\"><span class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-md bg-white shadow-sm dark:bg-neutral-800\"></span><span class=\"relative z-10\">Usage</span></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"_R_5anpfksnksdb_-tab-props\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_5anpfksnksdb_-panel-props\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"relative inline-flex h-9 items-center rounded-md px-4 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring text-foreground/55 hover:text-foreground\"><span class=\"relative z-10\">Props</span></button></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"_R_5anpfksnksdb_-panel-usage\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_5anpfksnksdb_-tab-usage\" style=\"opacity:1;transform:none\"><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute right-3 top-3 z-10\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-lg bg-secondary p-1\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy\" class=\"relative inline-flex size-7 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface-overlay text-foreground shadow-sm transition-colors duration-150 will-change-transform hover:bg-surface-overlay/80 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"shrink-0 size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></path><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></rect><path d=\"M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5\" class=\"text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" opacity=\"0\" pathLength=\"1\" stroke-dashoffset=\"0\" stroke-dasharray=\"0 1\"></path></svg></button></span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 px-5 py-4 pr-16 shadow-xs text-[13px] leading-6\" data-language=\"tsx\"><code class=\"font-mono text-foreground/90\">import { Navbar } from &quot;@/components/ui/Navbar&quot;;\n\n&lt;Navbar\n  variant=&quot;floating&quot;\n  logo={&lt;Wordmark /&gt;}\n  items={[\n    { label: &quot;Product&quot;, content: &lt;ProductMenu /&gt; },\n    { label: &quot;Pricing&quot;, href: &quot;/pricing&quot;, active: true },\n    { label: &quot;Docs&quot;, href: &quot;/docs&quot; },\n  ]}\n  actions={\n    &lt;&gt;\n      &lt;a href=&quot;/login&quot;&gt;Log in&lt;/a&gt;\n      &lt;a href=&quot;/signup&quot;&gt;Get started&lt;/a&gt;\n    &lt;/&gt;\n  }\n/&gt;</code></pre></div></div></div></section><section id=\"use-cases\" class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"mb-5 text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\">Use cases</h2><ul class=\"grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2\"><li class=\"rounded-lg border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 p-4 shadow-xs\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-tight\">SaaS landing pages</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] leading-5 text-muted-foreground\">The header every template starts with, pairing with the announcement bar, hero and pricing section.</p></li><li class=\"rounded-lg border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 p-4 shadow-xs\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-tight\">Docs and changelog sites</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] leading-5 text-muted-foreground\">A bar variant with an active link and a product dropdown over long, scrolling pages.</p></li><li class=\"rounded-lg border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 p-4 shadow-xs\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-tight\">Marketing sites with a hero image</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] leading-5 text-muted-foreground\">The floating variant stays transparent over the hero and only becomes a surface once the page moves.</p></li></ul></section></div><section id=\"related\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl scroll-mt-24 px-4 pb-16 sm:px-8 lg:px-16\" aria-labelledby=\"related-heading\"><div class=\"mb-5 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4\"><h2 id=\"related-heading\" class=\"text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\">Related components</h2><a class=\"text-[13px] text-muted-foreground underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/components/sections\">All Sections components</a></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"group relative flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-secondary/50 p-1 transition-colors hover:border-border hover:bg-secondary\" href=\"/components/shader-nav\"><div class=\"aspect-video w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-muted\"><img src=\"/thumbs/shader-nav.webp\" alt=\"Shader Nav preview\" width=\"960\" height=\"557\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-full object-cover\"/></div><div class=\"px-1.5 pb-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><h3 class=\"min-w-0 truncate text-[13px] font-medium text-foreground p-1\">Shader Nav</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock size-3 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground/50\" aria-label=\"Pro\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\